# PixelSync Studio — environment configuration
#
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT: OPTIONAL. If unset, submitting the form opens the
# visitor's email app with the inquiry pre-filled, addressed to
# pixelsyncweb@gmail.com. If set, the form POSTs JSON here instead
# (silent inbox delivery, no email app required).
#   - Formspree        https://formspree.io/f/<your-id>
#   - Web3Forms        https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (include access_key in the body)
#   - Any serverless function you deploy (e.g. Vercel / Netlify / Cloudflare)
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
